    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>TreeView organizes nested data into expandable nodes and supports templated data sources, checkbox selection, filtering, custom switcher icons, context menus, and lazy child loading.</source>
        <target state="translated">TreeView 将嵌套数据组织为可展开节点，并支持模板化数据源、复选选择、过滤、自定义展开图标、上下文菜单和懒加载子节点。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Display hierarchical data with selectable, checkable, searchable, draggable, and async-loaded nodes.</source>
        <target state="translated">展示层级数据，支持选择、勾选、搜索、拖拽和异步加载节点。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
